        ],
        "text": "According to Steven W. Seymour, the case concerns whether the four shareholder\u2011directors of the petitioner\u2019s gastroenterology clinic are employees for purposes of the Americans with Disabilities Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner; Respondent",
        "citations": [
